{{Top}}
{{Youmay|the position of trooper, [[soldier]]s sometimes referred to as "troops"|the military division [[troop]]|linebreak=1}}
{{MoreSources}}
{{Quote|The best trooper is a smart trooper.|An Imperial stormtrooper|<ref name="Fallen Order">''[[Star Wars Jedi: Fallen Order]]''</ref>}}
[[File:Stormtroopers-SWRFacebook.png|thumb|right|300px|Stormtroopers served as soldiers of the Galactic Empire.]]
'''Troopers''',<ref name="ESB">{{Film|V}}</ref> sometimes referred to as '''troops''' or '''grunts''',<ref name="Bombad Jedi">{{TCW|Bombad Jedi}}</ref> were [[soldier]]s who served in a military force.

Examples of troopers throughout [[Timeline of galactic history|galactic history]] included the [[Republic Defense Coalition troop|Galactic Republic troopers]] of the [[Republic Defense Coalition]] who got their first taste of real combat during the [[Nihil conflict]],<ref name="TOS1">[[The High Republic: Trail of Shadows 1|''The High Republic: Trail of Shadows'' 1]]</ref> the [[clone trooper]]s of the [[Grand Army of the Republic]], who were [[Cloning|bred]] on the planet [[Kamino]] using the genetic template of the Mandalorian bounty hunter [[Jango Fett]],<ref name="AOTC">{{Film|II}}</ref> the [[stormtrooper]]s of the [[Galactic Empire]], who were elite troops<ref name="stormtroopers">{{Databank|stormtroopers|Stormtroopers}}</ref> deployed on the frontlines<ref name="Episode VI">{{Film|VI}}</ref> and stationed aboard installations such as [[Star Destroyer]]s,<ref name="SW36">[[Star Wars (2015) 36|''Star Wars'' (2015) 36]]</ref> the [[Rebel trooper|Alliance troopers]] of the [[Alliance to Restore the Republic|Rebel Alliance]],<ref name="The Rebel Files">''[[Star Wars: The Rebel Files]]''</ref> the [[First Order stormtrooper|stormtroopers]] of the [[First Order]],<ref name="TLJ VD">''[[Star Wars: The Last Jedi: The Visual Dictionary]]''</ref> and the [[Resistance trooper]]s<ref name="Resistance Trooper DB">{{Databank|resistance-troopers|Resistance Troopers}}</ref> of [[General]] [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa's]] [[Resistance]].<ref name="TLJ VD" />

